+# json-patch-diff Specification
+
+## Purpose
+Defines how a JSON Patch (RFC 6902) describing the difference between two JSON documents is produced, so that only what changed needs to be sent.
+
+## Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Patch transforms from into to
+`createPatch(from, to)` SHALL return an array of RFC 6902 operations such that applying it to `from` (RFC 6902 §5) yields a document equal to `to`. Equality of objects ignores member order (RFC 8259 §4).
